---
import ArticleLink from '@components/ArticleLink.astro';
import BookLink from '@components/BookLink.astro';
import GradientBar from '@components/GradientBar.astro';
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Page from '@components/Page.astro';
import Section from '@components/Section.astro';
import Spotify from '@components/Spotify.astro';

import articles from '@public/arcticles.json';
---

<Layout title="rwl 2024">
  <Page title="2024">
    <nav class="flex flex-row justify-between" aria-label="Read watch listen years">
      <a class="text-blue-600 underline dark:text-blue-400" href="/rwl/2023">&lt; 2023</a>
      <span></span>
    </nav>

    <div class="space-y-1 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      <p>⏳ - In Progress</p>
      <p>🎧 - Audiobook</p>
    </div>

    <Section title="books">
      <BookLink
        href="https://us.macmillan.com/books/9781250183866/extremeownership"
        label="Extreme Ownership: How U.S. Navy SEALs Lead and Win"
        inProgress
      />
    </Section>

    <hr class="border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800" />

    <Section title="articles">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        {
          articles["2024"].map((article) => <ArticleLink article={article} /> )
        }
      </div>
    </Section>

    <hr class="border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800" />

    <Section title="albums">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Vital Remains</b> - <i class="love">Forever Underground (1997)</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album="4QVNkNupB8vSFeVUxVKVo0" />
          </div>
          <p>I've been on a death metal kick this year, and this album really stands out from the rest. The intro is hard as nails.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Worm</b> - <i class="love">Foreverglade (2021)</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album="36Q9lOsmM3UCm3bxUDifJf" />
          </div>
          <p>Worm has quickly become one of my favorite modern metal artists. Fantastic mix of BM, DM, and doom. I love the cosmic aesthetic as well.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p><b>Ninth Realm</b> - <i class="love">A Fate Unbroken (2022)</i></p>
          <div class="lg:w-[25vw]">
            <Spotify album="06aP2l0zQRDvvAHm45qDH5" />
          </div>
          <p>Checked these guys out on a whim while scrolling Power Trip's related artists on Metallum. Really solid crossover without aping PT or sounding too core/thrash.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>

    <GradientBar />
  </Page>
</Layout>
